# Lazy evaluation: $filter doesn't force tail elements beyond what's needed
# Take 1 element from filtered Seq - the error in the tail shouldn't fire
[collect [take 1
    [filter
     [fn [let x] [< x 10]]
     [seq 5 [seq [raise "should not evaluate"] []]]]]]
=== error
